<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(Cam)ONS(LocAux1)[XIC(LocFlag) ,XIC(PositionCheckEnable) XIC(Input) ]XIC(PositionCheckEnable)OTL(LocScrap);]]>
